# Vendored archives are opt-in. Only libchdr — the one dependency the build
# cannot satisfy locally — and libjuice (netplay ICE; recomp-net would
# otherwise download it at configure time) are committed; tools/ci/vendor_deps.sh stages the
# rest here on demand for air-gapped builds, and those must not be committed
# (SDL3 alone is ~15 MB).
*.tar.gz
*.tar.xz
*.tar.bz2
*.zip
!libchdr-*.tar.gz
!libjuice-v*.tar.gz
